extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 3: England printed 41-43 (cache p042-p044, cache page = printed folio + 1). Printed 41 is glyph-corrupt in the cache, so its powers, bonuses and cauldron text were read off a render; the skill list on printed 42 was read off a render too. The entry starts at The Scathach O.C.C. heading on printed 41 and ends at Cybernetics & Bionics on printed 43. || GROUP: under The Woodland Druids (printed 38), one of its three orders; warriors and blacksmiths, but druids with a P.P.E. base and Special Magic Powers, so occ_group is magic; it states no S.D.C. base, so men_of_arms is false (its S.D.C. comes from Body Building, Boxing and its other physical skills). || XP: the column headed Herbalist, Woodland Druids, Blood Druids on the Experience Tables, printed 152 (cache p153), read off a render; a note there names the Woodland Druids as the Dryad, Filidh and Scathach. Every low bound is the previous high plus one. || POOLS: hit points not printed; P.E. + 1D6 per level as for the book''s other O.C.C.s. P.P.E. P.E. x2, +1D6+4 per level. || BONUSES: +1D6 P.S.; +3 vs faerie magic, foods and drinks (faerie_magic); +3 vs poisons and unwanted magic potions and foods (toxins_poisons); +2 vs all other types of magic, stored on spell_magic and ritual_magic; +2 vs horror factor. || SKILLS: each base is the catalog base plus the printed bonus. Mystic Herbology is the row of printed 22 (+5%). Identify Plants and Fruits is the catalog Identify Plants & Fruit; Cooking is Cook; Horsemanship is Horsemanship: General; Pilot: Sailboats, Motorboats and Ships are Boat: Sail Type, Boat: Motor, Race & Hydrofoil and Boat: Ships; W.P. Archery & Targeting is W.P. Archery; Body Building is Body Building & Weight Lifting. English has no language row and rides Language: Other at the printed figure (row ruling, 2026-11-12: no language skill rows); Gobblely has a row. Hand to Hand: the page grants Martial Arts and says it can be changed to Expert at the cost of one other skill, the sentence the Herbalist and Dryad print beside Basic; it is transcribed as printed, costs { expert: 1 }, though Expert is the lesser style. Pilot any is read to include the Horsemanship category at +5%. || EQUIPMENT: two cauldrons of choice except Destruction; the magic hammer; two other magic irons or items of wood and iron; one magic weapon; magic horseshoes on the horse; 2 of the 2D4 magic herbs or herb items from every held herb-* row, the rest by hand. All Scathach items are the scathach-* rows shipped with the Mystic Herbology skill, citing this book. Not stored: three dozen large nails, a black work apron, and heavy armor worn on the road. Pouches or sacks are stored as one pouch."
